				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Exterminating mosquitoes from your house requires a comprehensive approach. Thus, at 7 States Pest Control, our <a href="https://7statespestcontrol.com.au/" rel="noopener">affordable pest control Melbourne</a> consultants implement scientifically-proven methodologies to eliminate the pest from commercial and residential properties. Our effective pest control methods target the mosquito life cycle’s larval stage. With our practices, we try to eradicate different species of mosquitoes, including Aedes.</p>								</div>
